    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist shows up for a temporary job helping with a merchandise changeover at a department store\u2019s clothing shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of the shift, they are asked to try on a new item of clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, when they step out of the fitting room, the store has transformed into a bizarre and unsettling scene...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they be able to escape safely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide: In areas where enemies appear, there are places where you can hide. You can avoid enemies by hiding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items: Obtain and use items that help you progress through the game or are required to clear it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices: You may be presented with choices in response to items or events discovered during exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity Gauge: The sanity gauge decreases when encountering terrifying events. If it reaches zero, it\u2019s game over.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Horror Game: A play style of \u201crun and hide\u201d in response to paranormal phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings: The ending may change depending on the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls: Playable with keyboard and mouse.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Streaming and Let's Plays</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome the following uses of gameplay footage: introductions, Let\u2019s Plays, and live streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the [game title] and a link to the Steam store page in the video description would mean a lot to us as developers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist shows up for a temporary job helping with a merchandise changeover at a department store\u2019s clothing shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of the shift, they are asked to try on a new item of clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, when they step out of the fitting room, the store has transformed into a bizarre and unsettling scene...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they be able to escape safely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide: In areas where enemies appear, there are places where you can hide. You can avoid enemies by hiding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items: Obtain and use items that help you progress through the game or are required to clear it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices: You may be presented with choices in response to items or events discovered during exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity Gauge: The sanity gauge decreases when encountering terrifying events. If it reaches zero, it\u2019s game over.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Horror Game: A play style of \u201crun and hide\u201d in response to paranormal phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings: The ending may change depending on the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls: Playable with keyboard and mouse.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Streaming and Let's Plays</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome the following uses of gameplay footage: introductions, Let\u2019s Plays, and live streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the [game title] and a link to the Steam store page in the video description would mean a lot to us as developers.</p>",
    "short_description": "A temp worker at a department store's clothing section is trapped in a strange phenomenon. This psychological horror walking simulator has multiple endings. Search for clues, collect items, and hide to survive. You can't fight\u2014only escape. Avoid fear, stay sane, and choose wisely to survive.",
